  "body": "In the [§ Sites](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/origin.html#sites), it is unclear why the last example:\r\n(\"`https`\", \"`wildlife.museum`\") vs. (\"`https`\", \"`wildlife.museum`\")\r\nis not considered as [schemelessly same site](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/origin.html#schemelessly-same-site) (or same site), even if they are identical.\r\n\r\nThough it might have been so defined before the definition of the “schemelessly same site” is updated by previous commits e.g., https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/5287.",
